{"id":"interme_diaire","lemma":"intermédiaire","pos":"adj","rank":4604,"glosses":["intermediate"],"ipa":"/ɛ̃.tɛʁ.me.djɛʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/25/Fr-interm%C3%A9diaire.ogg/Fr-interm%C3%A9diaire.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"intermédiaires"},"examples":[{"text":"J'étais l'intermédiaire.","en":"I was the go-between.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"J'ai les examens intermédiaires, la semaine prochaine.","en":"I have midterms next week.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"examination","l":"examen"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"week"},{"g":"upcoming","l":"prochain"}]},{"text":"Il a servi d'intermédiaire entre les deux parties.","en":"He mediated between the two parties.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to serve (to help in a…","l":"servir"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"between"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"two"},{"g":"genitals"}]},{"text":"Elle s'est exprimée par l'intermédiaire d'un interprète.","en":"She spoke through an interpreter.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"through"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"interpreter"}]},{"text":"Nous communiquons les uns avec les autres par l'intermédiaire de la langue.","en":"We communicate with one another by means of language.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to communicate","l":"communiquer"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"a, an","l":"un"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"other","l":"autre"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"the / it"},null,null,null,{"g":"tongue"}],"phrases":[[10,12,"of the"]]}]}